4-602.13 The following nonfood contacts surfaces were soiled:
1) bulk powder storage bins - outer surfaces (general buildup);
2) prep cooler - bottom inside (food splash) & doors (general buildup - especially along bottom);
3) bottom shelves of prep tables (crumbs/debris);
4) reach-in freezer - bottom inside (food debris) & around door (grease);
5) carts (food crumbs/general buidup); and
6) dust pan (heavy buildup of food/debris). 
Ensure cleaning of general surfaces daily/as needed. Nonfood contact surfaces shall be cleaned at a frequency necessary to eliminate buildup of grease, food splash and general debris.
